<title>USA: American Eagle sets annual meeting.</title>
<headline>American Eagle sets annual meeting.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Eagle Group Inc said Tuesday it has set an annual meeting for July 30, where shareholders will be asked to approve the sale of its general aviation insurance business.</p>
<p>Shareholders of record as of June 30 will be eligible to attend.</p>
<p>American Eagle, an insurance holding company, announced in April it planned to sell the business to American Financial Group Inc.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
